exports[`opencode CLI help-text snapshots every documented command emits stable help text: opencode github --help 1`] = `
"█▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀█ █▀▀▀▄ █▀▀▀▄ ▄▀▀▀▄ █▀▀▀▀ ▀▄ ▄▀
