█▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄█ █     █  ▀▄ █   █ █▄▄▄▄ ▄▀ ▀▄

Commands:
  praex [project]           start Praex in the terminal (your own frontier models)         [default]
  praex run [message..]     run praex with a message
  praex login               sign in to Praex · Velox II free with your Google account
  praex logout              sign out of Praex
  praex models [provider]   list all available models
  praex upgrade             update praex to the latest version                     [aliases: update]
  praex providers           manage AI providers and credentials                      [aliases: auth]
  praex mcp                 manage MCP (Model Context Protocol) servers
  praex agent               manage agents
  praex session             manage sessions
  praex stats               show token usage and cost statistics
  praex export [sessionID]  export session data as JSON
  praex import <file>       import session data from a JSON file made by praex export
  praex pr <number>         fetch and checkout a GitHub PR branch, then run praex
  praex plugin <module>     install plugin and update config                         [aliases: plug]
  praex attach <url>        attach to a running praex server
  praex serve               start a headless praex server
  praex web                 start praex server and open web interface
  praex acp                 start ACP (Agent Client Protocol) server
  praex debug               debugging and troubleshooting tools
  praex db                  database tools
  praex uninstall           uninstall praex and remove all related files
  praex completion          generate shell completion script

Positionals:
  project  path to start praex in                                                           [string]

Options:
  -h, --help                  show help                                                    [boolean]
  -v, --version               show version number                                          [boolean]
      --print-logs            print logs to stderr                                         [boolean]
      --log-level             log level         [string] [choices: "DEBUG", "INFO", "WARN", "ERROR"]
      --pure                  run without external plugins                                 [boolean]
      --port                  port to listen on                                [number] [default: 0]
      --hostname              hostname to listen on                  [string] [default: "127.0.0.1"]
      --mdns                  enable mDNS service discovery (defaults hostname to 0.0.0.0)
                                                                          [boolean] [default: false]
      --mdns-domain           custom domain name for mDNS service (default: praex.local)
                                                                   [string] [default: "praex.local"]
      --cors                  additional domains to allow for CORS             [array] [default: []]
  -m, --model                 model to use in the format of provider/model                  [string]
  -c, --continue              continue the last session                                    [boolean]
  -s, --session               session id to continue                                        [string]
      --fork                  fork the session when continuing (use with --continue or --session)
                                                                                           [boolean]
      --prompt                prompt to use                                                 [string]
      --agent                 agent to use                                                  [string]
      --rc, --remote-control  start with Remote Control on (continue from the Praex app or
                              praex.ai/rc)                                                 [boolean]
"
`;

